  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": [
        "Pulse travels only along Lattice Conductors. Your first conductor joins the drum and the station; as your camp spreads out, weave more.",
        "Conductors within 8 blocks of each other link into one network, and everything within 8 of any of them is on it: a generator at one end of camp powers a machine at the other. One craft makes four.",
        "Each conductor carries **64 Pulse a second** to begin with. When a network has to carry more, [rank](machine_ranks) its conductors (256, 1,024, then 4,096 a second) or add more beside the busy generator and machine.",
        "Ritual Chalk joins totems for their voices: right-click one with **Ritual Chalk** (bone meal, lapis and a Spirit Shard make four sticks), then another less than 16 blocks away. Chalk carries voices, never Pulse."
      ]
    },
